<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="28310479"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440824743"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Dear Boy (Avicii by Avicii)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Avicii / MØ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="True: Avicii By Avicii"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:35.000"><div begin="00:34.270" end="04:35.000"><p begin="00:34.270" end="00:42.650" itunes:key="L1">So bold and fine, I've known you for some time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此勇敢 如此优秀</span></p><p begin="00:42.650" end="00:51.020" itunes:key="L2">Whole life changed while bones like yours and mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整个人生都已改变</span></p><p begin="00:51.020" end="00:58.520" itunes:key="L3">Go dance in the woods and down we go, down, down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在林中舞蹈</span></p><p begin="00:58.520" end="01:06.980" itunes:key="L4">Oh boy, you're mine, do you remember old times?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">男孩 你是属于我的</span></p><p begin="01:06.980" end="01:10.190" itunes:key="L5">Oh, dear boy, I wanna follow you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的男孩 我想跟随你的脚步</span></p><p begin="01:10.190" end="01:15.200" itunes:key="L6">You're a wild boy, I am a wild girl, too<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狂野的你，放肆的我</span></p><p begin="01:15.200" end="01:19.430" itunes:key="L7">Oh, dear boy, I'm hollow without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的男孩 没有你 我倍感空虚</span></p><p begin="01:19.430" end="01:23.660" itunes:key="L8">In a world with everything, but it won't do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使拥有一切 感觉心里总是缺了一块</span></p><p begin="01:23.660" end="01:27.760" itunes:key="L9">Oh, dear boy, I wanna follow you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的男孩 我想跟随你的脚步</span></p><p begin="01:27.760" end="01:32.090" itunes:key="L10">You're a wild boy, I am a wild girl, too<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你狂野无畏 我也放纵不羁</span></p><p begin="01:32.090" end="01:36.220" itunes:key="L11">Oh, dear boy, it's so hollow in the blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的男孩 没有你 我倍感难受</span></p><p begin="01:36.220" end="01:40.300" itunes:key="L12">It's a chance, boy, everything and I can know you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我呼唤着你 这是属于我们的时刻</span></p><p begin="03:04.580" end="03:12.980" itunes:key="L13">Old love of mine, destruction ain't a crime<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我最亲爱的你 再大的破坏也不是罪</span></p><p begin="03:12.980" end="03:21.160" itunes:key="L14">For those who find love as a game, like you and I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对你和我这样沉迷于爱情游戏的人来说</span></p><p begin="03:21.160" end="03:29.030" itunes:key="L15">Go dance in the waters of all the tears we've cried<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随着我们的泪水 翩翩起舞</span></p><p begin="03:29.030" end="03:36.640" itunes:key="L16">Oh boy, we're fine, do you remember our time?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">男孩 我们这样就很好 你是否记得我们的旧日时光</span></p><p begin="04:02.230" end="04:06.240" itunes:key="L17">Oh, dear boy, I wanna follow you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的男孩 我想跟随你的脚步</span></p><p begin="04:06.240" end="04:10.670" itunes:key="L18">You're a wild boy, I am a wild girl, too<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你狂野无畏 我也放纵不羁</span></p><p begin="04:10.670" end="04:14.850" itunes:key="L19">Oh, dear boy, it's so hollow in the blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的男孩 没有你 我倍感空虚</span></p><p begin="04:14.850" end="04:17.990" itunes:key="L20">It's the time for everything and I found you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使拥有一切 感觉心里总是缺了一块</span></p><p begin="04:17.990" end="04:22.990" itunes:key="L21">Oh, dear boy, I wanna follow you</p><p begin="04:22.990" end="04:27.630" itunes:key="L22">You're a wild boy, I am a wild girl, too<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你狂野无畏 我也放纵不羁</span></p><p begin="04:27.630" end="04:31.660" itunes:key="L23">Oh, dear boy, it's so hollow in the blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的男孩 没有你 我倍感难受</span></p><p begin="04:31.660" end="04:35.000" itunes:key="L24">If you're down, boy, everything and I can know you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我呼唤着你 这是属于我们的时刻</span></p></div></body></tt>